# Format with Prettier

After creating or modifying any file in `frontend/src/`, run Prettier on the changed files before finishing the task.

```bash
# From the frontend directory — single file
npx prettier --write src/features/player/components/PlayerPage.tsx

# Multiple files in one command
npx prettier --write src/features/player/components/PlayerPage.tsx src/routes/_app/player.tsx
```

- Run Prettier on every file you create or edit in this session, not only the final file.
- Use paths relative to `frontend/` (as in the examples above).
- Do not skip formatting because the diff is small — always format after component or module changes.
- Project config lives in `frontend/.prettierrc` (4-space indent, single quotes, trailing commas).
